WEBVTT

NOTE English translation; original display timings, not word alignment.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
In this classroom, the teacher
and classmates are AI.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.300
You're the only human here.

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.000
This is OpenMAIC's official demo.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.700
Question on the left,
AI discussion on the right.

5
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.133
You can join in.

6
00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:17.233
It turns learning into
a back-and-forth conversation.

7
00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:18.733
Where do lessons come from?

8
00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:21.733
Give it a topic or source material.

9
00:00:21.733 --> 00:00:24.967
It builds an outline,
then the lesson pages.

10
00:00:24.967 --> 00:00:28.200
The classroom's different characters
respond in turn.

11
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.500
The appeal is this way of learning.

12
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.600
More AI discussion
doesn't make an answer correct.

13
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.300
To run your own,
you'll need to configure models.

14
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.067
Check important facts, too.

15
00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:42.400
Want a classroom where you can
keep asking questions? Take a look.

16
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.833
OpenMAIC's repository link
is in the comments.
